Query:
--Description: 10) Final combined query: patient, study, series, storage URL, and total size (MB) for the broader “MEDIA” condition.  
SELECT p."PatientID",
       p."StudyInstanceUID",
       p."SeriesInstanceUID",
       p."StudyDate",
       p."PatientAge",
       p."PatientSex",
       p."BodyPartExamined",
       a."series_aws_url",
       ROUND(SUM(a."instance_size")/1000000, 2) AS "series_size_MB"
FROM IDC.IDC_V17.DICOM_PIVOT AS p
JOIN IDC.IDC_V17.DICOM_ALL    AS a
  ON a."SeriesInstanceUID" = p."SeriesInstanceUID"
WHERE p."BodyPartExamined" ILIKE '%MEDIA%'
  AND p."PatientSex" = 'M'
  AND p."PatientAge" ILIKE '018%'
  AND p."StudyDate" > '2014-09-01'
GROUP BY p."PatientID",
         p."StudyInstanceUID",
         p."SeriesInstanceUID",
         p."StudyDate",
         p."PatientAge",
         p."PatientSex",
         p."BodyPartExamined",
         a."series_aws_url"
LIMIT 20
Answer:
PatientID,StudyInstanceUID,SeriesInstanceUID,StudyDate,PatientAge,PatientSex,BodyPartExamined,series_aws_url,series_size_MB
